---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Button from '../components/ui/Button.astro';
import BreadcrumbSchema from '../components/SEO/BreadcrumbSchema.astro';
import ProfilePageSchema from '../components/SEO/ProfilePageSchema.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="Our Story - Why We Built Intently | A Kinder Approach to Screen Time" description="Built at 2am by someone who couldn't stop scrolling. Intently was born from the belief that you don't need to be controlled—you just need one moment of awareness to choose differently." />
		<BreadcrumbSchema
			items={[
				{ name: "Home", url: "https://liveintently.app" },
				{ name: "About", url: "https://liveintently.app/about" }
			]}
		/>
		<ProfilePageSchema />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />

		<main>
			<!-- About Hero -->
			<section class="about-hero">
				<div class="container">
					<h1>We Built This Because We Needed It Too</h1>
					<p class="hero-subtitle">Intently wasn't born in a boardroom. It was born at 2am, during yet another scroll session that left us feeling empty. We knew there had to be a kinder way.</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Mission -->
			<section class="mission">
				<div class="container">
					<div class="mission-content">
						<h2>Our Belief</h2>
						<p>You're not broken. You're not weak. The apps on your phone were designed by thousands of engineers to be irresistible. The fact that you're here, looking for a solution, means you're already fighting back.</p>
						<p>We believe you don't need to be controlled. You need to be seen. Intently doesn't lock your phone or shame you into compliance. It simply gives you a moment—one breath, one question—before the autopilot kicks in. In that moment, you remember who you are and what you actually want.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Values -->
			<section class="values">
				<div class="container">
					<h2 class="section-title">Our Values</h2>
					<div class="values-grid">
						<div class="value-item">
							<div class="value-icon">🔒</div>
							<h3>What Happens on Your Phone Stays on Your Phone</h3>
							<p>We designed Intently so that even we cannot see your data. Not because regulations require it—because we believe your private moments are sacred.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="value-item">
							<div class="value-icon">🧘</div>
							<h3>Awareness, Not Punishment</h3>
							<p>Blocking apps feels like putting a lock on the fridge. It doesn't address why you're hungry. Intently addresses the why—by creating moments of awareness where you can choose consciously.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="value-item">
							<div class="value-icon">🎯</div>
							<h3>Science-Backed, Human-Tested</h3>
							<p>Our approach is grounded in research on habit formation and behavioral psychology. But the real proof? The thousands of people who tell us they finally feel in control—not the other way around.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="value-item">
							<div class="value-icon">💚</div>
							<h3>Built for Humans, Not Metrics</h3>
							<p>We'll never add infinite scroll, push notifications designed to create anxiety, or 'engagement' features. Our success metric is simple: the less you need us, the better we've done our job.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Story -->
			<section class="story">
				<div class="container">
					<div class="story-content">
						<h2>The Story Behind Intently</h2>
						<p>It was 1:47am on a Tuesday. I'd been scrolling for two hours. I didn't even remember opening Instagram. My thumb was moving, but I wasn't there.</p>
						<p>When I finally put the phone down, I felt hollow. Not relaxed. Not entertained. Just empty. And angry—at myself, at the app, at whoever designed that endless feed to be so perfectly, maddeningly addictive.</p>
						<p>I'd tried screen time apps before. They blocked me out of my own phone like a parent grounding a child. They showed scary usage stats designed to shame me. None of it worked.</p>
						<p>That night, I had a different idea. What if an app didn't try to control me? What if it just asked me a question? One simple question, right before the scroll started: 'Is this what you want to be doing right now?'</p>
						<p>That question became Intently.</p>
						<p>Today, over 12,000 people use that moment of pause to choose their own path. Some days they choose to scroll—and that's fine. The point was never to eliminate screens. The point was to make it a choice. Your choice.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- CTA -->
			<section class="cta-section">
				<div class="container">
					<div class="cta-content">
						<h2>You're Already Taking the First Step</h2>
						<p>The fact that you're here means something. Take the next step—it's free, private, and takes 30 seconds.</p>
						<div class="cta-buttons">
							<Button href="/download" variant="primary" size="lg">Download Intently</Button>
							<Button href="/blog" variant="secondary" size="lg">Read Our Blog</Button>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	main {
		width: 100%;
	}

	.about-hero {
		width: 100%;
		padding: var(--intently-space-2xl) 0;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--intently-blue) 0%, #00BCD4 100%);
		color: white;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.about-hero h1 {
		font-size: 2rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		margin: 0 0 var(--intently-space-md);
		color: white;
	}

	.hero-subtitle {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		max-width: 700px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		opacity: 0.95;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.mission {
		width: 100%;
		padding: var(--intently-space-2xl) 0;
		background: var(--intently-bg-primary);
	}

	.mission-content {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.mission-content h2 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0 0 var(--intently-space-xl);
		color: var(--intently-text-primary);
	}

	.mission-content p {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: var(--intently-text-secondary);
		margin: 0 0 var(--intently-space-xl);
	}

	.values {
		width: 100%;
		padding: var(--intently-space-2xl) 0;
		background: var(--intently-bg-secondary);
	}

	.section-title {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-align: center;
		margin: 0 0 var(--intently-space-3xl);
		color: var(--intently-text-primary);
	}

	.values-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
		gap: var(--intently-space-xl);
	}

	.value-item {
		text-align: center;
		padding: var(--intently-space-xl);
		background: white;
		border-radius: var(--intently-radius-lg);
	}

	.value-icon {
		font-size: 3rem;
		margin-bottom: var(--intently-space-md);
	}

	.value-item h3 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0 0 var(--intently-space-sm);
		color: var(--intently-text-primary);
	}

	.value-item p {
		color: var(--intently-text-secondary);
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.story {
		width: 100%;
		padding: var(--intently-space-2xl) 0;
		background: var(--intently-bg-primary);
	}

	.story-content {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.story-content h2 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0 0 var(--intently-space-xl);
		color: var(--intently-text-primary);
	}

	.story-content p {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: var(--intently-text-secondary);
		margin: 0 0 var(--intently-space-xl);
	}

	.cta-section {
		width: 100%;
		padding: var(--intently-space-2xl) 0;
		background: var(--intently-bg-secondary);
		text-align: center;
	}

	.cta-content h2 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0 0 var(--intently-space-md);
		color: var(--intently-text-primary);
	}

	.cta-content p {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		color: var(--intently-text-secondary);
		max-width: 600px;
		margin: 0 auto var(--intently-space-xl);
	}

	.cta-buttons {
		display: flex;
		gap: var(--intently-space-md);
		justify-content: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.cta-buttons .btn {
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.container {
		max-width: 1400px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 1rem;
	}

	/* Responsive - Mobile First */
	/* Tablet: more spacing */
	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.about-hero,
		.mission,
		.values,
		.story,
		.cta-section {
			padding: var(--intently-space-3xl) 0;
		}

		.about-hero h1 {
			font-size: 2.5rem;
		}

		.section-title,
		.mission-content h2,
		.story-content h2,
		.cta-content h2 {
			font-size: 2rem;
		}

		.values-grid {
			grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		}
	}

	/* Desktop: even more spacing */
	@media (min-width: 1024px) {
		.about-hero,
		.mission,
		.values,
		.story,
		.cta-section {
			padding: var(--intently-space-4xl) 0;
		}

		.about-hero h1 {
			font-size: 3rem;
		}

		.section-title,
		.mission-content h2,
		.story-content h2,
		.cta-content h2 {
			font-size: 2.5rem;
		}

		.values-grid {
			grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
		}
	}

	/* Mobile: optimize layouts */
	@media (max-width: 767px) {
		.values-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.cta-section {
			padding-left: 0;
			padding-right: 0;
		}

		.cta-content {
			padding: 0 var(--intently-space-md);
		}

		.cta-buttons {
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: var(--intently-space-md);
			margin-left: calc(-1 * var(--intently-space-md));
			margin-right: calc(-1 * var(--intently-space-md));
			width: calc(100% + var(--intently-space-lg));
		}

		.cta-buttons .btn {
			width: 100%;
			box-sizing: border-box;
		}
	}

	html {
		scroll-behavior: smooth;
	}

	a:focus-visible,
	button:focus-visible {
		outline: 2px solid var(--intently-blue);
		outline-offset: 2px;
	}
</style>
